      "text": "Savva is a specialty coffee house in Madinah. The room is quiet by design: soft light, a recently refreshed interior, and a terrace for the cooler hours. The coffee of the day moves between Ethiopian and Colombian beans, and the cheesecake rarely lasts the afternoon. Doors open early and close at two.",
